'''Nuzleaf''' (Japanese: '''コノハナ''' ''Konohana'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

