==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Power Keepers|Nuzleaf|36}} from the {{TCG|EX Power Keepers}} expansion; both cards have the Gentle Slap attack.
*'''Gentle Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Psyduck|70}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

